README: minimal vendored punkt_tab data for LearnGraph images.

Pipecat (pipecat.utils.string.match_endofsentence) always calls NLTK's
sent_tokenize, so the container needs `tokenizers/punkt_tab/english/` to exist.
The official download pulls ~11 MB of every language from
raw.githubusercontent.com, which is not reachable from the build or the runtime
container of this deployment.

NLTK's loader (nltk/tokenize/punkt.py: load_punkt_params) reads exactly four
files and accepts empty ones, so this directory ships them empty on purpose:
Punkt then splits on orthographic rules instead of learned statistics, which is
what the voice pipeline needs (Chinese/English sentence boundaries).

Regenerate equivalent data locally with:
    python -m nltk.downloader -d <dir> punkt_tab
